      "label_en": "Five-profile measurements",
      "scope_zh": "固定五项性能配对全部完成，每臂672请求、零失败；另有4K/16K连续负载。",
      "scope_en": "All five performance pairs completed: 672 requests per arm, zero failures; additional 4K/16K continuous load.",
      "baseline_id": "original018-cann8.5.1",
      "method_zh": "固定MMLU200、HLE四层比例200、Frontier160、SWE32任务/64请求、Terminal32任务/48请求。两臂使用各自冻结预算和共同预热协议，预热及同模型辅助评分不计入正式性能。吞吐计入整批排空；TPOT按请求等权平均。连续负载另按C8/out256/300秒提交后排空。",
      "method_en": "Fixed MMLU200, stratified HLE200, Frontier160, SWE32 tasks/64 requests and Terminal32 tasks/48 requests. Both arms retain the frozen answer budgets and common warmup protocol. Warmup and same-model grading are excluded from performance. Throughput includes cohort drain; TPOT is request-weighted. Continuous load separately uses C8/out256 and 300s submissions plus drain.",
      "quality_note_zh": "HLE每臂各1题评分未解析，Frontier为4/8题；均保留在原计划分母。长度终止单列。SWE/Terminal仅测轨迹推理性能，不测Agent解决率。",
      "quality_note_en": "One unresolved HLE grade per arm; Frontier has 4/8. All remain in the planned denominator. Length stops are separate. SWE/Terminal measure trace inference, not agent solve rates."
    }
